          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na maraika owa kashatu yaateera; enyonyoozi mpango, erikwaka nk'orumuri, yaagwa neeruga omu iguru; yaagwa ahari kimwe kya kashatu ky'emigyera n'aha nshuro z'amaizi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi eiziina ry'enyonyoozi egyo ni ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8:11",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Apusinto n'ekiti ekirikushaarira nk'omuravunga.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apusinto. Ekicweka kya kashatu ky'amaizi kyahinduka omurura; abantu baingi baafa, baitwa amaizi ago, ahakuba gakaba nigashaarira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.8.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
