              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kur 10:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi maraika owa kana nawe yaateera eye nzamba, ekicweka kya kashatu ky'eizooba n'ekicweka kya kashatu ky'okwezi n'ekicweka kya kashatu ky'enyonyoozi byateerwa; n'ahabw'ekyo ekicweka kya kashatu ky'okwaka kwabyo kyaba omwirima; eizooba ryarereera kwaka ekicweka kya kashatu kya nyomushana, kandi na nyekiro byaba bityo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.8.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
