              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku naimukize amaisho naareeba eishamba nirizeereera omu mwanya, naahurira nirigamba n'eiraka rihango riti: Ai mbambe! Ai bambe! abatuura omu nsi baryareeba enaku, ku barihurira amaraka g'enzamba ezi baamaraika abashatu barikwenda kuteera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
